{"summary":"故炊帚即旧炊帚，外用可治疗面部白癜风（白驳），需在月食夜与诸药共烧成灰，用醋调敷患处。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"（出自《本草拾遗》）"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"人面生白驳，以月食夜。和诸药烧灰，苦酒调敷之（藏器）。","translation":"人脸上生出白驳（白癜风），要在月食之夜，和多种药一起烧成灰，用醋调敷患处。（陈藏器）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#故炊帚","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}